    "introduction": "Compass Group provides outsourced catering and related support services to organisations such as employers, hospitals, schools, universities and sporting venues. Rather than depending on a single restaurant brand, it operates food services at client sites under contracts adapted to different settings. Revenue comes from meals served and agreed service arrangements, with economics varying according to contract terms and customer attendance. Purchasing scale, menu planning, staffing and kitchen operations are central to delivery. Its broad client base gives exposure to multiple end markets, while retaining contracts and winning new outsourcing work support growth. Food inflation, labour availability and service quality directly affect day-to-day performance.",
